[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mFailure impact, criticality and triage — one Cypher query each,\u001b[0m \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mzero LLM tokens.\u001b[0m 137/139 AssetOpsBench scenarios pass at 63 ms, \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m vs 65% for GPT-4 over flat docs. The win is the data model.     \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
